@startuml Master Data Management - Sequence Diagram

skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceActorFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceBoxFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontName Times New Roman

title Sequence Diagram - Mengelola Master Data (Admin Gudang)

actor "Admin Gudang" as Admin
participant "Filament UI" as UI
participant "Resource" as Resource
participant "Model" as Model
participant "Database" as DB

== Manage User ==
Admin -> UI: Akses menu Master Data\n(Pilih: Pengguna)
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request user list
activate Resource
Resource -> Model: Get active users
activate Model
Model -> DB: Query users
activate DB
DB --> Model: Return data
deactivate DB
Model --> Resource: Collection<User>
deactivate Model
Resource --> UI: User list data
deactivate Resource
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan daftar user
deactivate UI

Admin -> UI: Pilih aksi CRUD\n(Create/Update)
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Show form
activate Resource
Resource --> UI: Render form
deactivate Resource
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan form
deactivate UI

Admin -> UI: Input/Update data pengguna
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Submit data
activate Resource

Resource -> Resource: Validasi data

alt Validation Success
    Resource -> Model: Create/Update user
    activate Model
    Model -> DB: Save to database
    activate DB
    DB --> Model: Success
    deactivate DB
    Model --> Resource: User instance
    deactivate Model
    Resource --> UI: Success response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan hasil operasi
    deactivate UI
else Validation Failed
    Resource --> UI: Validation errors
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan error
    deactivate UI
end

== Manage Supplier ==
Admin -> UI: Akses menu Master Data\n(Pilih: Supplier)
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request supplier list
activate Resource
Resource -> Model: Get active suppliers
activate Model
Model -> DB: Query suppliers
activate DB
DB --> Model: Return data
deactivate DB
Model --> Resource: Collection<Supplier>
deactivate Model
Resource --> UI: Supplier list data
deactivate Resource
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan daftar supplier
deactivate UI

Admin -> UI: Buat supplier baru
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Show create form
activate Resource
Resource --> UI: Render form
deactivate Resource
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan form
deactivate UI

Admin -> UI: Input data supplier
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Submit data
activate Resource

Resource -> Resource: Validasi data

alt Validation Success
    Resource -> Model: Create supplier
    activate Model

    note right of Model
        - Generate kode supplier otomatis
        - Set status aktif
    end note

    Model -> DB: Save to database
    activate DB
    DB --> Model: Success
    deactivate DB
    Model --> Resource: Supplier instance
    deactivate Model
    Resource --> UI: Success response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan hasil operasi
    deactivate UI
else Validation Failed
    Resource --> UI: Validation errors
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan error
    deactivate UI
end

== Manage Product ==
Admin -> UI: Akses menu Master Data\n(Pilih: Produk)
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request product list
activate Resource
Resource -> Model: Get active products
activate Model
Model -> DB: Query products with supplier
activate DB
DB --> Model: Return data
deactivate DB
Model --> Resource: Collection<Product>
deactivate Model
Resource --> UI: Product list data
deactivate Resource
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan daftar produk
deactivate UI

Admin -> UI: Buat/Edit produk
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Show form
activate Resource
Resource --> UI: Render form
deactivate Resource
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan form
deactivate UI

Admin -> UI: Input/Update data produk
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Submit data
activate Resource

Resource -> Resource: Validasi data

alt Validation Success
    Resource -> Model: Create/Update product
    activate Model

    note right of Model
        - Generate kode produk (jika baru)
        - Catat pergerakan stok (jika ada perubahan)
        - Update stock quantity
    end note

    Model -> DB: Save to database
    activate DB
    DB --> Model: Success
    deactivate DB
    Model --> Resource: Product instance
    deactivate Model
    Resource --> UI: Success response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan hasil operasi
    deactivate UI
else Validation Failed
    Resource --> UI: Validation errors
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan error
    deactivate UI
end

@enduml
